The differing box in the first panel covers the front label area of the right Secret deodorant, from about the "Secret" logo down to the bottom of the label. It does not cover the whole product facing: the cap and the top of the bottle are cut off, so the box is only part of the object. It is a loose, partial box rather than a tight one around the full product.

The second panel has no box. Since the box in the first panel is bad (partial coverage of one product), the panel without it is better.

